#. help text 1/4
#: src/include/nis/ui.rb:620
msgid ""
"<p>Normally, it is possible for any host to query which server a client is "
"using. Disabling <b>Answer Remote Hosts</b> restricts this only to the local "
"host.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ໂຮສໃດກໍສາມາດສອບຖາມໄດ້ວ່າລູກຂ່າຍກຳລັງໃຊ້ເຊີເວີໃດຢູ່. ການປິດ "
"<b>ຕອບສະໜອງໂຮສທາງໄກ</b> ຈະຈຳກັດໃຫ້ສະເພາະໂຮສພາຍໃນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.</p>"

#. help text 2/4
#. Check, ie. turn on a check box
#: src/include/nis/ui.rb:629
msgid ""
"<p>Check <b>Broken server</b> if answers from servers running on an "
"unprivileged port should be accepted. It is a security risk and it is better "
"to replace such a server.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໝາຍຕິກ <b>ເຊີເວີທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ</b> "
